## Transformations Applied
  - T-01 Extract Configuration to Environment → src/config/index.js, .env.example (PORT, HOST, DB_PATH, PAYMENT_GATEWAY_KEY, ADMIN_TOKEN, LOG_LEVEL); segredos antigos removidos
  - T-03 Split God Class into MVC Layers → src/models/*, src/services/*, src/controllers/*, src/routes/*, src/app.js
  - T-04 Output Serializer with Field Allow-list / log sem dados sensíveis → src/services/paymentGateway.js (cartão mascarado `****1234`, chave nunca logada)
  - T-05 Guard Admin Endpoints by Configuration → src/middlewares/adminGuard.js, src/routes/adminRoutes.js (timingSafeEqual, 403 "Forbidden")
  - T-06 Hash Passwords with Standard Library → src/models/passwordHasher.js, src/models/userModel.js, src/models/database.js (seed com hash); badCrypto removido
  - T-07 Move Business Rules to Model/Service → src/services/checkoutService.js, src/models/reportModel.js, src/services/userService.js; controllers finos
  - T-08 Inject Dependencies via Composition Root → src/app.js (createApp injeta db, logger, gateway, models, services); globalCache/totalRevenue removidos
  - T-09 Wrap Multi-step Writes in Transaction (async/await) → src/models/database.js (transaction com BEGIN/COMMIT/ROLLBACK em fila), src/services/checkoutService.js, src/services/userService.js (DELETE remove payments + enrollments + user)
  - T-10 Replace N+1 with Join → src/models/reportModel.js (1 consulta em vez de 1+N+2·N·M; ORDER BY c.id, e.id)
  - T-11 Centralize Input Validation → src/utils/validators.js (corpo ausente / card não-string → 400 "Bad Request")
  - T-12 Centralized Error Handler and Domain Exceptions → src/utils/errors.js, src/middlewares/errorHandler.js, src/middlewares/asyncHandler.js
  - T-14 Extract Named Constants/Enums → src/models/constants.js (PAYMENT_STATUS, APPROVED_CARD_PREFIX, DEFAULT_PASSWORD, UNKNOWN_STUDENT)
  - T-15 Rename Internals, Keep External Contract → src/utils/validators.js (usr/eml/pwd/c_id/card → userName/email/password/courseId/cardNumber), AppManager → camadas nomeadas
  - T-16 Structured Logging and Dead Code Removal → src/utils/logger.js; removidos totalRevenue, globalCache, logAndCache, dbUser/dbPass/smtpUser

